WEBVTT

00:01:30.636 --> 00:01:32.836
If your car gets stolen, yes,

00:01:32.876 --> 00:01:35.516
the insurance company
will cushion the blow.

00:01:35.996 --> 00:01:37.836
With the compensation money,

00:01:37.876 --> 00:01:40.116
you could probably afford a new car.

00:01:40.436 --> 00:01:42.596
But the fact that you have insurance

00:01:42.636 --> 00:01:45.556
does not make your car
less likely to be stolen.

00:01:45.916 --> 00:01:49.516
The risk is the same
whether you are insured or not.

00:01:50.276 --> 00:01:52.076
So are people this naive?

00:01:52.116 --> 00:01:54.876
Do they really believe
that if they have insurance,

00:01:54.916 --> 00:01:56.356
they are less at risk?

00:01:57.316 --> 00:01:58.676
Yes.

00:01:58.716 --> 00:02:01.156
Perhaps not consciously, but they do.